SUMMARY:Montclair Art Museum and Montclair Scholarship Fund
DESCRIPTION:Visit the Montclair Art Museum (MAM) September 25–27 and the proceeds of gallery admissions will go toward a new MAM Scholarship that will support a creative MHS senior who has committed to the study of fine or visual arts in college. The Museum is delighted to fund this new annual award that will be administered by the Montclair Scholarship Fund. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
