SUMMARY:1000 Books Before Kindergarten PARTY!
DESCRIPTION:It’s time to celebrate our young readers who have been 
 listening to hundreds and hundreds of books! Please attend to give our 
 first congrats to the children who have completed their 1000 Books Before 
 Kindergarten program. We will update your child’s reading logs and prizes 
 or sign up any new members. There will also be time to read aloud to your 
 child to update their tracking logs. Light refreshments will be provided. 
 Registration only.\n\n
