X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Metrotrails": "https://www.meetup.com/metrotrails/events/316424285/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_metrotrails
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Metrotrails Hiking
UID:event_316424285@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260926T045342Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T183000
SUMMARY:Boonton Area Loop Hike and Railroad History Visit
DESCRIPTION:Metrotrails: NJ\, PA\, NY Metropolitan Area Hiking and More!\n
 Join us for this loop hike around Boonton NJ area\, which will feature par
 ks we have done as well as not done\, connected by short back street jaunt
 s.\nThe main theme is that we will walk to and through the Tri State Railw
 ay Historical Society Open House day\, featuring a huge collection of vint
 age rail stuff!\nAfter we meet at the Acme\, we'll walk back streets and f
 ields to the event to arrive shortly after it starts.\nThen after we spend
  an hour or so there\, we'll continue on some different community trails. 
 We will weave through and cover as much of this as possible that we have n
 ot done before\, as well as ones we have such as the Trolley Trail and the
  Tourne.\nHow much of the stuff we do will depending on how we are doing o
 n mileage and how much daylight we have.\nWe may adjust our route along th
 e way. Planned route is about 15 miles.\nCost for entry is $10 at the door
  for adults or $8 online preordered.\nIf needed\, contact me at 908 343 83
 74
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/metrotrails/events/316424285/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260904T232331Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260904T232331Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup North Jersey Bowling Soccer Volleyball": "https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball/events/315550830/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_north_jersey_bowling_soccer_volleyball
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_315550830@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260926T045343Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T120000
SUMMARY:Weekend Warrior Tennis (Sundays)
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nJoin us for
  friendly and sociable free rallies and possibly some informal matches for
  training and fun. We are beginner to intermediate levels but all are welc
 ome. We don’t allow formal instruction on our group-reserved courts\, al
 though giving some quick tips is OK so long as you’re not holding up oth
 ers waiting to play.\n\n⛑️ **Clinic Matches:** If we have to rotate pe
 ople in then we may play some clinic-style matches where everyone rotates 
 in evenly. There is no holding the court via wins so everyone has a chance
  to play regardless of skill level.\n\n🕊️ **Early Bird Start:** If yo
 u want to meet earlier than 9 AM (like 8 or 8:30) then please let us know 
 by the day before and we’ll see who can join you (usually I can do earli
 er).\n\n**🎾 Equipment:** Please bring your own racquet and water\, as w
 e don’t provide those. I always have some balls for at least one court\,
  but feel free to bring your own in case we need to branch out over more t
 han one court.\n\n**🧯DISCLAIMER:** Courts are subject to availability a
 nd weather. If you make plans to attend please be prepared to cancel or ad
 just our location as needed. Furthermore\, by attending you agree to be fu
 lly responsible for your own health and safety. Each person is responsible
  to take a break for rest and water at their own discretion.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315550830/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260704T234148Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260704T234148Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
