SUMMARY:Montclair Town-Wide Yard Sale
DESCRIPTION:The fall edition of the Montclair Town-Wide Yard Sale will be happening on Sunday\, September 27 (new date since it was raining last week). This free event is open to all\, whether you decide to host a yard sale in your yard / driveway / garage\, or just shop around town. You can register for the event and get added to interactive map via this link: https://qrto.to/38d8bc1c. A few days before the event we will publish our map via the same link and on our IG/FB pages. See you out there! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/montclair-town-wide-yard-sale-3/
LOCATION:montclair\, nj\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
