DESCRIPTION:<span>On<span> </span></span><b><b>Wednesdays at 1pm\, typica
 lly twice a month\,</b></b><span> a small group will gather to meditate an
 d knit. </span><span>This is a </span><b><b>spiritual practice</b></b><sp
 an> that benefits the practitioner and those gifted with these </span><b
 ><b>sacred mantles</b></b><span>. This ministry is<span> </span><b><b>non
 denominational</b></b><span> </span>and<span> </span><b><b>open to anyon
 e</b></b><span> who is seeking to step away from their daily stresses wit
 h an alternative </span><b><b>form of meditation</b></b><span>.  </span>
