SUMMARY:Beginner Irish - Online
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to register. 
 \n\nJoin us for a beginner's introduction to the Irish language! This class 
 will cover spelling\, pronunciation\, common phrases and vocabulary. Along 
 the way\, you will learn Irish first and last names and the original\, 
 meaningful place names (Logainmneacha) of Ireland.\n\nThe first class will 
 take place online. All subsequent classes will take place in person at the 
 Montclair Public Library\, 50 S. Fullerton Avenue.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Classroom\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
