DESCRIPTION:Salonettes are small\, recurring living-room conversations 
 where neighbors gather to learn about the issues shaping their community 
 and connect with local leaders—think of it as a book club without a book. 
 Curious about hosting a salonette of your own? Join founder Anjali Dalal to 
 learn more!
