DESCRIPTION:Join us on Fridays for a day full of events for Seniors with 
 the MILL @ MPL! All events are free and open to the public. Registration is 
 recommended unless otherwise noted.\n\n\nProtecting your online accounts 
 starts with strong password practices. In this lecture\, we’ll review 
 password basics before exploring options like single sign-on\, passkeys\, 
 etc.\n\nHOW TO REGISTER\nThis class is run by the MILL. Please register for 
 classes directly through their website here.\n\nFor questions about MILL 
 classes please call 973-744-3278.\n\nMILL @ MPL is made possible through a 
