SUMMARY:A Celebration of Pets
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261004T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261004T160000
DTSTAMP:20260926T045335Z
UID:5im966e70kl6jaln44g2r1q7p4@google.com__20261004
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20231002T132802Z
DESCRIPTION:<span>Each year\, on <strong><b><span>the First Sunday of Octo
 ber</span></b></strong><span> </span>from <strong><b><span>1-4pm</span></
 b></strong> Holy Spirit Verona hosts <strong><b><span>A Celebration of Pe
 ts</span></b></strong> in the <strong><b><span>Verona Town Hall Square</
 span></b></strong><span> </span>(600 Bloomfield Avenue) with <strong><b>
 <span>pet-orientated activities\, rescue organizations\, vendors\, crafts-
 people\, pet blessings and more</span></b></strong>. We have <strong><b><
 span>activities for kids</span></b></strong>\, <strong><b><span>a DJ</span
 ></b></strong></span><span>\, <strong><b><span>food vendors</span></b></s
 trong> and a<strong><b><span> Pet Parade at 2:30pm</span></b></strong> 
 with prizes in several categories. If you have a pet or love all God's cre
 atures\, join us!  </span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260504T190653Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Church of the Holy Spirit Verona
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Unioncong": "https://www.unioncong.org/event/family-fun-day-camp-johnsonburg/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:unioncong
