 ately 2 hours 10 minutes (including intermission).\n\nMontclair State Uni
 versity Students FREE with ID at Kasser Box Office\n\n\nHosted by: The Co
 llege of the Arts\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://mont
 clair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12607744
