SUMMARY:Misti Peruvian Jazz Duo
DESCRIPTION:Program Description\n\nMisti Peruvian Jazz Duo performs unique 
 jazz improvisation with Andean and Afro-Peruvian music and Latin American 
 classics in an intimate concert. The program showcases Peruvian 
 contemporary artists and Latin American musical diversity.\n\nAbout the 
 artists\n\nPeruvian musicians Sofía Carrasco (tenor saxophone) and Victor 
 Sotomayor (piano)\, co-founders of Misti Music & Education\, form the Misti 
 Peruvian Jazz Duo.\nMisti Music & Teaching combines jazz and Peruvian music 
 via teaching\, performance\, and innovation.\nSofia and Victor\, jazz 
 musicians and educators from Jersey City\, New Jersey\, blend Andean and 
 Afro-Peruvian musical styles with their compositions.
LOCATION:West Orange - Community Room 1
ORGANIZER;CN="West Orange Library":MAILTO:events@westorange.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-10341-17236155
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17236155
END:VEVENT
