SUMMARY:Montclair Public Library Book Drive
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a book drive and sale to benefit the Montclair 
 Public Library!\nHosted by the Montclair Public Library Foundation and 
 Friends of the Montclair Public Library.\n\n \n\nWhat to 
 Donate:\n\n\n	Clean and gently used hardcover and softcover books: adult 
 and children\, English and other languages\, fiction and 
 nonfiction.\n	DVDs\, Blu-rays\, CDs\, & audio book CDs in their original 
 printed jackets or cases. No VHS or cassette tapes\, 78’s\, or 
 self-recorded media\n\n\n \n\nWhat Not to Donate:\n\nWe CANNOT ACCEPT 
 anything that is:\n\n\n	Falling apart\n	Moldy\n	Heavily 
 underlined\n	Otherwise unsuitable for sale\n\n\nWe also DO NOT ACCEPT the 
 following:\n\n\n	Encyclopedia sets\n	Reader’s Digest Condensed books (or 
 similar)\n	Textbooks\n	AAA travel guides or maps\n	Travel guides that are 
 more than 3-4 years old (unless they are very old)\n	Puzzles or board 
 games\n	Magazines\n	VHS tapes (video tapes)\n	Music cassettes\n	Greeting 
 cards or postcards\n
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-10306-17654807
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17654807
END:VEVENT
