X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_nj_code_coffee
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Code & Coffee
UID:event_316133448@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260926T045343Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T170000
SUMMARY:NJ Code & Coffee - Newark Tech Week edition
DESCRIPTION:NJ Code & Coffee\nCalling all New Jersey techies to the **NJ C
 ode and Coffee** tech community meetup at the EqualSpace ES550 Tech & Inno
 vation campus during Newark Tech Week!\n\nCode and Coffee is an inclusive\
 , informal networking/co-working session for those in tech (and the tech-c
 urious).\nThat includes operators\, founders\, and investors. Developers\,
  data engineers\, UX/UI designers\, data scientists\, product managers\, s
 oftware engineers\, solution architects... **all are welcome!**\n\nPeople 
 of all skill and experience levels can attend\, we love it that way. Many 
 people (optionally) bring projects to work on\, and many other people (opt
 ionally) socialize the entire time. It's entirely up to you!\n\nCome grab 
 a cup of coffee and meet new people\, share stories\, find collaborators\,
  talk about everything tech\, talk about everything NOT tech\, take a brea
 k from job applications\, get away from the computer screen\, make connect
 ions\, make conversation\, **make friends!**\n\n**Agenda:**\n**2pm:** Door
 s open\, networking starts\n**2:30pm:** Intro circle\n**3pm:** networking 
 continues\n**5pm:** event ends\n\n**The Intro Circle**\n**Near the beginni
 ng of the event (about 2:30 pm)\, we will do a standup in a circle:**\nWe 
 first talk about organizer announcements\, updates\, and logistics. Then w
 e go around the circle where each person says:\n\n* your name and job titl
 e/ role in tech/ tech stack\,\n* What you can help others with\,\n* What y
 ou would like help with\,\n* Job opportunities you're hiring for OR announ
 ce that you are looking for one. If none\, that's cool.\n\nAfter the intro
 duction circle\, everything is self-organized.\n\n**Community Discord - co
 me hang out before and after!:**\n[www.codeandcoffee.chat](www.codeandcoff
 ee.chat)\n\n**The Venue**\nEqual Space is a premium share-space created wi
 th multicultural business owners in mind\, =SPACE equips founders with res
 ources\, programming and a powerful network.\n\nHeadquartered in the City 
 of Newark\, their share-space provides resources for startups\, coaching f
 or tech companies\, and a wealth of intellectuals to collaborate and build
  with. The next wave in enterprises is being born within their walls. Beco
 me a part of the story: [EqualSpace.co/](https://equalspace.co/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/nj-code-coffee/events/316133448/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260815T221043Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260815T221043Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
