 ia the telephone</b>.<br>Via computer/smartphone (ideally with a camera an
 d microphone): <a href="https://zoom.us/j/2010208686" target="_blank">http
 s://zoom.us/j/2010208686</a><br>Telephone (for audio only): 1 (646) 876 99
 23 - Meeting ID: 201 020 8686  <span>- Participant ID = # (not applicabl
 e).</span><br><br>Email <a href="mailto:office@holyspiritverona.org" targe
 t="_blank">office@holyspiritverona.org</a> for the <b>required passcode</b
 >.<br><br>For a copy of our <b>Sunday Worship Booklet and Scripture Insert
 </b>\, <a href="https://www.holyspiritverona.org/worship-booklet-and-scrip
 ture-readings.html" target="_blank">click here</a>.<br><br>A full worship 
 service with music.<br><br>Our 10am service can also be viewed Live (or af
 ter the fact) on our <a href="https://www.facebook.com/holyspiritverona/" 
 target="_blank">Facebook page</a>.
