SUMMARY:Modern Calligraphy Workshop for Adults
DESCRIPTION:Join The Spotted Canvas for a fun and relaxing Modern 
 Calligraphy Workshop designed for beginners. Participants will learn the 
 fundamentals of modern calligraphy\, including proper pen technique\, basic 
 strokes\, lettering\, and how to connect letters to create beautiful words 
 and phrases. Each participant will have the opportunity to practice their 
 new skills and create their own personalized calligraphy piece to take home 
 and enjoy.\n\nNo prior experience is necessary. All materials will be 
 provided.\n\nRegistration required.
LOCATION:West Orange - Community Room 1\, West Orange Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="West Orange Library":MAILTO:events@westorange.bccls.org
