DESCRIPTION:Through tarot\, numerology and contemplation we will cast three 
 distinct perspectives drawn from ancestral divining in order to discover 
 what our departed lineage is ready to let go of.\n\nFor those who attended 
 the Ketu in Leo talk\, this is a deeper dive into the workings of that 
 lecture. \n
