SUMMARY:Men's Group Gathers at Pilgrim Diner
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T100000
DTSTAMP:20260926T045335Z
UID:1c91be10t5qa3m7nro4qj3mp0l@google.com__20261114
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260909T195120Z
DESCRIPTION:<span>In the Spring of 2026\, parishioner Ken Traficante began
  an informal once-a-month gathering of men at Holy Spirit Verona. Having c
 haired the Building and Grounds (B&amp\;G) Committee for many years\, Ken 
 wanted to recreate the fellowship that would happen on B&amp\;G Work Day e
 vents when parishioners volunteered time to clean up and repair items arou
 nd the Church's campus. Ken scheduled a Saturday morning once a month at t
 he Pilgrim Diner in Cedar Grove with a group of 6-8 guys during which they
  would share conversation and life experience with one another. This break
 fast group will now meet on the <b>second Saturday of each month from 8:30
  to 10am</b> (unless otherwise indicated on the website calendar). For mo
 re information\, speak with Father Jerry or Ken Traficante</span><span>.</
 span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260909T195120Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Church of the Holy Spirit Verona
END:VEVENT
