 <p><span>Arrive at 9:30am to participate in our Pageant. Parents should dr
 op their child off in the <b><span>Sunday School Room (lower level) by 9:
 30am </span></b>as preparation for <b><span>the Pageant preparation will
  start promptly at 10am</span></b>. </span><span>After the service all are
  invited into the Fellowship Room for Coffee Hour.</span></p>
